    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz, the years I spent studying in Victoria weren't just for show."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "There, I studied the most cutting-edge science and technology pertaining to Catastrophe and Originium research."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Things that seem to fall within the realm of the divine to you, may well be a fact of reality for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Everything that I've learned, as well as everything I believe in, tells me that I am right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady, you did not go to law school."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "What is Rhodes Island trying to do at the City Hall?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Searching for evidence to use against Cronin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Cronin may be slimy, but he's not stupid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "He's a Catastrophe Messenger. There's no way he doesn't know about the volcano's situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I'm sure he's hiding the truth for his own benefit, and as long as we can gather the evidence secretly..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "I think Rhodes Island will confront him directly, so that whole secret search is unlikely to succeed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "It-it's fine! Since you're not there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Milady, I want to know why you're doing this. If you give me a reasonable answer, I won't go after Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "...This is something I have to do. I don't believe that my father is such a cold-blooded person. He would never stand by idly and let this happen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "My father loves this city more than anyone else. And I know that better than anyone else."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Do you still hate him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Why would I? If anything, he should be the one who hates me, because my birth took my mother's life..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "But he never resented me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "What I hate is how he arranges everything for me and never tells me what he's planning."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "It may seem like he's protecting me, but the end result is that I only end up ignorant and helpless."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Just like right now! It must be Cronin's fault; he must have hidden the truth about the eruption from my father."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "That's the only reason he ordered Cronin to stop me! Would you call that hate?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Eruption?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "What Cronin said was, you were going to reveal Master Doykos's secrets, so that he would be dismissed and put on trial."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "What?! No, what did my father even do in the past?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "Don't worry about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "...Hmm, I see what is going on now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "So Cronin wasn't even under my father's orders when he tried to capture me. Phew, that about clears things up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz, if I really wanted to do something like that, I would have gone through legal channels."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Everything that I'm doing is also for the sake of this city, my hometown."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "I understand. Milady, you're not concerned about the past, or about social standings."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "I feel the same way as you. As does your father."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Phew... No matter what others think, I'll always trust you and my father."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Even if there's a conflict between our goals, I trust that we'll be able to resolve things between the two of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "That's why I believed that you'd be here. We both understand this city well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "That's why you'd come to stop me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Come to think of it, it doesn't really matter who the mayor is, right? I'm sure that's what my father would think. What he cares about is this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "That's why I know he'll agree with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz... wouldn't you agree?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "You've grown, milady."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.6
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
